stateDiagram-v2

    [*] --> Cycle : power-on

    state Cycle {
        [*] --> FixedTiming
        FixedTiming --> MLControl : ML enabled via API
        MLControl --> FixedTiming : ML disabled via API
    }

    Cycle --> Override : POST /api/override
    Override --> Cycle : override cleared

    Cycle    --> Emergency : RFID scanned
    Override --> Emergency : RFID scanned

    Emergency --> Cycle : 5s all-red timer expires
